       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. WEEKDAY.
      * The ISO day of the week of a YYYYMMDD date: 1 Monday, 7 Sunday.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-DAY-NUMBER PIC 9(7).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-DATE    PIC 9(8).
       01 LK-WEEKDAY PIC 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-DATE LK-WEEKDAY.
           COMPUTE WS-DAY-NUMBER = FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(LK-DATE) - 1.
           COMPUTE LK-WEEKDAY = FUNCTION MOD(WS-DAY-NUMBER, 7) + 1.
           GOBACK.
